---
import Container from "../components/container.astro";
import Layout from "./_layout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import aboutBanner from "../images/about/about_banner.png";
import Heading from "@/components/ui/heading.astro";
import FloatingPanel from "@/components/floating_panel.astro";
import { P } from "@/components/ui/text";
---

<Layout title="About Us" description="">
  <FloatingPanel shadow="y">
    <Container>
      <Heading>About Us</Heading>
    </Container>
  </FloatingPanel>

  <Container class="bg-gray-100 pt-16">
    <Image
      class="border-b-8 border-background"
      src={aboutBanner}
      height="341"
      width={1280}
      alt="Elevators and cleaning cart"
    />
  </Container>

  <Container class="bg-gray-100" size="sm">
    <div class="py-16 space-y-4">
      <P>
        At Saniclean, we are committed to earning your trust through exceptional
        service and long lasting client relationships. We have been proudly
        serving the commercial cleaning industry for over 26 years.
      </P>

      <P>
        Our founder, Anna Cartagena, brings a lifetime of experience to
        Saniclean. As a second generation professional in the cleaning industry,
        Anna grew up understanding the importance of organized, well maintained
        spaces and the role they play in presenting a positive, professional
        image. Her passion for cleanliness, attention to detail, and dedication
        to healthy, germ controlled environments continue to shape Saniclean’s
        high standards today.
      </P>

      <P>
        We believe strong client relationships are built through consistent
        service and open communication. Every Saniclean team member completes
        extensive training, including WHMIS and site specific orientations, to
        ensure safe work practices and consistent results. Our staff also meet
        required security clearances based on site needs, and we provide regular
        supervision to maintain quality.
      </P>

      <P>
        We are proud of our long term relationships with both our clients and
        staff. This commitment allows us to provide dependable, high quality
        cleaning services with a personal touch, giving clients peace of mind
        knowing who is working in their space.
      </P>

      <P>
        Most services are available on short notice, and we also offer 24 hour
        emergency support for our clients.
      </P>
    </div>
  </Container>
</Layout>
